('Sol — parquet, carrelage et tapis','10 x 8 m shop floor kit, warm honey timber plank sales area, teal/ivory checker tile entrance strip, matching small teal rug with pink border and discreet golden botanical pattern. Preserve the original three distinct floor zones. Main panels: ORTHOGRAPHIC PLAN with complete 10x8m outline, 3/4 axonometric of just floor no walls, underside module, side thickness section. Detail a repeatable 1x1m timber module, a 1x1m tile module and separate rug construction. Stylized broad grain marks, beveled planks, clean brass flush transition strip. All walking surfaces flush, no raised trip edges. Existing hatch location must remain a separate cutout/compatible tile, no floor spanning over hatch. Do not invent extra room layout.'),
('Plafond et poutres','10 x 8m interior ceiling system, warm cream plaster inset panels, four walnut transverse beams with refined teal/brass botanical end brackets; modular trim compatible with taller shop ceiling, unobstructed hanging fixtures. Primary ceiling is shown FROM BELOW (complete orthographic reflected ceiling plan), TOP, side SECTION and open axonometric underside. Detail beam-end joinery, perimeter cornice, and separate fixture attachment plates. Beam section roughly .14 x .24m. Do not place objects atop shelves or lower room headroom; vertical height determined at integration. No roof or additional storeys.'),
('Porte d’entrée','Front entrance door, green/teal painted timber, clear pale blue glass upper panel, stepped lower recessed panel, elegant cream trim and restrained gold leaf motif, aged brass knob with matching keyhole and separate latch. Door leaf .96m wide x2.20m tall x.05m thick. Show outside and inside, same right-hand knob as old front view, hinge line on left, side edge latch, top cross section, three-quarter slightly ajar including removable frame. Real continuous hinges axis, brass kickplate; no oversized text or sign because open/closed sign is a separate item.'),
('Porte de service','Service door, muted plum painted timber, two recessed molded panels, small subtle botanical gold corner details, brass lever and escutcheon, brass hinges, contrasting cream/teal frame. Leaf .96x2.20x.05m. Preserve knob/handle on left in primary exterior view with hinges on right. Front/back/side/top + three-quarter ajar, detail latch and hinge. More practical than front entrance. Separate frame and moving leaf. Do not add PRIVATE plaque, that is a separate later catalogue item.'),
('Suspension — pétales roses','Pendant lamp variant 0 redesigned as refined rose-pink scalloped enamel bell shade with six broad petal lobes, ivory inner diffuser, small brass leaf collar, dark textile cable and round ceiling rose. Shade diameter .60m, shade height .30m, cable separately adjustable, assembly height .70m. Bottom open with replaceable visible warm bulb, no dangling vines. Front/back/profile/top, especially UNDERSIDE closeup, exploded bulb/socket/collar. Same petal count and shade silhouette every view.'),
('Suspension — corolle jaune','Pendant lamp variant 1, warm ochre-yellow gently flared enamel shade inspired by a flower corolla, broad six-sided scalloped rim, teal cap with brass narrow collar, ivory reflective interior and central warm bulb, dark cable plus round ceiling mount. Diameter .60m, shade height .30m, adjustable cable. Distinct silhouette from rose lamp but same boutique collection. Front/back/profile/top and large underside bulb detail plus socket construction. No sunflower stems, fixture remains practical lamp.'),
('Vase — roses','Tall smoky rose-pink glass vase with softly faceted round body, modest pinched neck and gently flared thick lip, small removable gold oval botanical medallion on thin ivory neck cord, flat stable foot. EMPTY vessel height .34m diameter .24m, wall thickness visible at rim. The FRONT/BACK/PROFILE/TOP views MUST show EMPTY vase with clearly open hollow interior. Large 3/4 example with three airy red/ivory/pink roses slightly different heights, not dense. Smaller empty 3/4 and cutaway base/water insert. Flowers and water separate removable components, compatible with ANY player-chosen flower. No price or permanent species label; do not fuse flowers to vase.'),
('Vase — tulipes','Elegant mint-green ceramic vase, slightly tapered oval body and flared undulating oval rim, shallow vertical ribs, cream foot and tiny brass botanical badge. Empty vessel H.34m W.24m D.21m. FRONT/BACK/SIDE/TOP show empty hollow interior and underside foot; 3/4 example with three gently bending pink, yellow and lilac tulips varying height, airy open spacing. Additional empty 3/4 and rim section. All flowers removable, any species allowed, do not print species name or price.'),
('Vase — lys','Refined ivory ceramic urn vase, narrow stable pedestal, broad fluted shoulder and gently rolled open mouth, teal bands with discreet embossed leaf relief, brass thin rim. Empty vessel H.34m maxdiameter.25m. Orthographic FRONT/BACK/PROFILE/TOP MUST be empty container, opening and thickness clear. 3/4 styling example with three lilies at varying heights ivory and pink, green narrow leaves, light airy not dense; second empty3/4, rim and base section. Any flower can be placed by player, removable stems and water separately, no permanent species text or prices.'),
