('Vase — lavande','Slim muted-lilac ceramic vase, elongated slightly tapering body with a square-rounded shoulder and narrow oval open mouth large enough for stems, cream bottom ring, discreet stylized lavender sprig relief NOT real protruding foliage. Empty H.34m W.20m D.18m. Orthographic face/back/side/top EMPTY with clear interior, large3/4 with 5 lavender stems airy differing heights, muted green leaves. Empty3/4, top wall thickness and foot detail. Separate flowers, player can use ANY species, no permanent labels or prices.'),
('Vase — marguerites','Friendly round sage-green ceramic vase with squat curved shoulder, open generous scalloped ivory rim and tiny daisy-like gold relief on body, distinct broad base. Empty H.30m W.27m. Orthographic front/back/side/top EMPTY. Large3/4 example 4 white daisies of slightly varied sizes/heights, visible separate stems and leaves, airy. Empty3/4 and ceramic wall/foot section. Species not locked, flowers any player choice, no prices, no fused flowers.'),
('Vase — coquelicots','Elegant muted-coral glazed vase, elongated rounded rectangular body, softened four corners, short narrowing neck with open dark burgundy rolled lip, understated cream incised stem motif. Empty H.34m W.23m D.20m. FRONT/BACK/PROFILE/TOP empty vessel with proper hollow mouth, 3/4 example3red poppies with thin stems at different heights and sparse serrated leaves; empty3/4 plus base and lip section. Any player flowers compatible, water separately removable, no text or price.'),
('Vase — fleurs xéno','Quirky sci-fi florist vase, deep teal/purple ceramic pear body with three small rounded stabilizing feet, wide open scalloped rim, restrained lime inset dots and subtle alien leaf relief, small side-mounted oval glass window, NOT a character/monster. Empty H.34m W.25m. FRONT/BACK/PROFILE/TOP empty hollow vase, large3/4 example with3 fantastical magenta/cyan xeno flowers, slightly varied height and petal sizes, airy not packed; empty3/4 and cutaway. Container accepts ANY species the player chooses; flowers, water, glow inserts all separate components. No eyes on vase, no species text, no price.'),
('Crâne fleuri d’étagère','Small decorative ivory skull flower holder for shelf, exaggerated cartoon smooth cranium, genuinely recessed dark orbital sockets (not protruding balls), triangular nasal cavity, 6-8 simplified teeth with readable spacing and integrated jaw, fine cheekbones, subtle two hairline cracks. Skull body H.20 W.20 D.22m, discreet flattened stable underside, hidden open aperture in crown to insert stems. FRONT/BACK/PROFILE/TOP EMPTY skull,3/4 styling one red rose with2leaves overall height.42m, second empty3/4 plus section showing opening and stable base. No gore. Flower detachable and can be replaced with any player choice.'),
